#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Rebuild your installed T3 Code Nightly with a stats bar under the composer.

Run it after every T3 Code update. Everything happens on this machine: the
patches in this repo are applied to the exact upstream commit your app was
built from and the web, server and desktop bundles are rebuilt. On Linux the
result is laid over a copy of your AppImage. On macOS your signed app is left
as it is and the launcher loads the rebuilt bundles into it at startup.
Your app and your T3 data are never modified.
"""
